OL,3,AEarl Spencer's unreleased book on Diana
OL,4,Astolen in the Netherlands
OL,5,
OL,6,FCopies of Earl Spencer's unreleased
OL,7,Fbook on his sister Diana, Princess of
OL,8,FWales, have been stolen from a truck in
OL,9,Fthe Netherlands.
OL,11,FThe BBC understands four copies of the
OL,12,FDutch language edition were taken from
OL,13,Fa truck while it was en route from the
OL,14,FDutch publisher's printers to their
OL,15,Fwarehouse.
OL,17,FDutch police said they were aware of
OL,18,Fthe incident and have been approached
OL,19,Ffor comment.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
